[26.554301, "o", "For the purpose of this task, assume that \"European Union countries\" refers to the official EU member states as of 2025-08-16 (the reference date).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[26.554349, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[26.554485, "o", "In the knowledge graph, countries are represented using their two-letter ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes as string values.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
